# I like it in Russian: мне нравится
subtitle: "Say what you like in Russian with мне нравится: the thing does the pleasing, so it keeps its plain form, and нравятся counts more than one."
thumb: "band \"Russian likes it backwards\" note \"мне нравится\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A second Russian story: read it all yourself","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/20-russian-review-2.cast"}

## I like it in Russian: мне нравится
level: basic

